#
# Every tailer calls loadEnv(), which walks up the tree looking for a .env
# and would find the repo's own - complete with whatever hub URL, serial
# port and watch directories the operator has configured. SUPER_LOG_ENV
# points the tests at this file instead, so a test's idea of the world comes
# entirely from its own arguments.
